1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,499
This is the WenQuest digital factory,

2
00:00:02,519 --> 00:00:05,937
a teaching industrial park where the plants supply one another.

3
00:00:06,957 --> 00:00:09,536
The gearbox plant builds a two-stage reducer.

4
00:00:10,006 --> 00:00:12,260
Click any machine to see what it is doing,

5
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:14,535
while AGVs carry material around the shop.

6
00:00:15,555 --> 00:00:17,556
An order comes in, MRP plans the materials,

7
00:00:18,026 --> 00:00:20,242
ERP schedules it and the work orders go to the shop,

8
00:00:21,262 --> 00:00:24,678
and the shop floor reports progress. From order to operation,

9
00:00:24,698 --> 00:00:26,142
it is all one data thread.

10
00:00:27,162 --> 00:00:30,060
The robot plant builds cobots, AGVs and a wheeled humanoid,

11
00:00:30,080 --> 00:00:32,731
using the gearbox plant's reducers as bought-in parts.

12
00:00:33,751 --> 00:00:36,016
A joint test bench measures backlash,

13
00:00:36,486 --> 00:00:38,725
and once a robot is at the customer,

14
00:00:38,745 --> 00:00:43,430
it keeps reporting back every day and raises an alarm when backlash drifts.

15
00:00:44,450 --> 00:00:46,685
Quality issues come with control charts

16
00:00:47,155 --> 00:00:50,151
and 8D, traced from one machine down to one batch.

17
00:00:51,171 --> 00:00:54,102
The command center shows the whole plant: it spots problems,

18
00:00:54,122 --> 00:00:55,921
traces causes and simulates outcomes.

19
00:00:56,941 --> 00:01:00,286
Downtime, shortages and low stock are flagged by the AI,

20
00:01:00,756 --> 00:01:03,332
each with its data source. People make the decisions.

21
00:01:04,352 --> 00:01:08,333
Students work through more than twenty labs here: order to delivery,

22
00:01:08,353 --> 00:01:10,686
root cause, calibration and after-sales,

23
00:01:11,156 --> 00:01:12,655
much like a real job.

24
00:01:13,675 --> 00:01:18,383
Enter the digital factory, or start with the factory demo, no sign-in needed.
